; Opening balances: what each account held on the day tracking started.
; Fill these in during /kickoff from your bank app (balances only, never account numbers).
; Example (uncomment and edit):
;
; 2026-10-01 * "Opening balance"
;   Assets:Bank:Checking        0.00 USD
;   Equity:Opening-Balances
;
; 2026-10-01 * "Opening balance"
;   Liabilities:CreditCard      -0.00 USD   ; debts are negative
;   Equity:Opening-Balances
;
; Then lock them in with balance assertions the next day, e.g.
; 2026-10-02 balance Assets:Bank:Checking   0.00 USD
